Package: grnland
Type: Package
Title: Evolution of Gene Regulatory Networks on Adaptive Landscapes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christoph", "Netz", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9309-8964")),
    person("Diogo", "Melo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "diogro@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7603-0092")),
    person("Lisandro", "Milocco", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3953-0407")))
Description: Individual-based simulations of populations whose phenotypes are
    the steady states of gene regulatory networks, evolving on arbitrary
    adaptive landscapes. Networks have any number of genes and arbitrary
    activating or repressing interactions (Hill-type kinetics), or are given as
    user-defined ODE systems. Provides analytical sensitivities and
    mutational (M) matrices of the genotype-phenotype map.
